  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Badri Prasad vs The State Of Jharkhand ...... Opposite ... on 8 August, 2023 In The High Court Of Jharkhand At Ranchi A.B.A. No. 5846 of 2023 Badri Prasad ...... Petitioner Versus The State of Jharkhand ......Opposite party ---------- Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Pradeep Kumar Srivastava ----- For the Petitioner : Mr. Mohit Prakash, Advocate For the State : Mr. Rajesh Kumar, A.P.P. .....",
    "facts": "2. Apprehending his arrest in connection with G(FA) Case No. 141 of 2011 instituted under Sections 16(1)(a)(i) of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, the petitioner has moved to this Court for grant of privilege of anticipatory bail. 3. As per prosecution case, there is allegation that petitioner is indulged in misbranding the Swastik Brand Sattu.",
    "arguments": "4. Learned counsel for the petitioner has submitted that petitioner is innocent and has committed no offence at all rather he has been falsely implicated in this case. It is submitted that there is no allegation that sattu was adulterated or sub-standard or unhygienic.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "4. Learned counsel for the petitioner has submitted that petitioner is innocent and has committed no offence at all rather he has been falsely implicated in this case. It is submitted that there is no allegation that sattu was adulterated or sub-standard or unhygienic.",
